Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本片開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,癡姦的俘虜 七海蒂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在廣告代理店工作4年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在業界第一線工作是我的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我是七海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七海 我是山本 前幾天謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:01:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七海妳提出的企劃很受好評
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於昨天的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.61,0:01:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 還有2小時資料就做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等完成我再傳給你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七海果然工作很快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能跟七海工作真是幫了大忙哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在工作上很努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托大家的福現在待遇還不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那個資歷 是我自信的自傲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高石 可以來一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這資料是什麼？ 是人要看的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有沒有想過再做？啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我有想過
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,排列亂七八糟 名詞也沒有統一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,概要又難懂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想的就是這個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.64,0:02:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再努力點 不要只是嘴上說要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你害的 我們的水準馬上就被看穿了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比我年長吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這工作給我確實做好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高尾 這資料13點前做好給我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼了的 因為簡訊沒回啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 想說工作做完再回的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒回去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帶回家裡做喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？ 都沒休息身體會弄壞吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣男人也不會靠近吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種事暫時沒關係 現在被越來越託付大案子很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 之後會回簡訊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 再見哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛的事情要忘記才行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我還有工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 因為叫妳也沒回應
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天說的資料 我修改好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是發生了什麼事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？ 可是七海你...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意外的會發出像女生的聲音啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.03,0:24:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高石？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.07,0:24:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按這裡的話
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.12,0:24:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就能上傳到SNS哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊？ 不可以做那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.25,0:24:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會變怎樣又沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊 妳會很糟糕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.16,0:24:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菁英廣告代理店...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.12,0:24:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若被看到這種事情的話
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.34,0:24:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定會完蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.61,0:25:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至今為止累積的東西全都泡湯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.62,0:50:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.73,0:52:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七海
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.43,0:52:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.12,0:52:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若不須再修改的話會很感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.34,0:52:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 若有問題的話 我會修改
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.98,0:53:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.12,0:54:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種地方若出聲的話會被聽見哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.97,0:56:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發出那種聲音的話會被聽到喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.12,1:03:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.00,1:03:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要走了喔 跟我來...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.88,1:03:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.39,1:04:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳也進來
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.66,1:04:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下來
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.00,1:10:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.13,1:13:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股翹高來含啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.12,1:14:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.12,1:14:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 再深點
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.12,1:14:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 快射了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.12,1:14:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.38,1:14:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要射了 嘴巴別放開喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.08,1:15:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要走了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.71,1:18:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,課長
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.28,1:18:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於16點開始的會議
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.12,1:18:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你到第二會議室
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.12,1:18:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.91,1:20:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想被癡漢而自己來了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.93,1:20:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我看
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.79,1:21:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼想要我做的話
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.92,1:21:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.48,1:21:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.12,1:21:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.48,1:22:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.12,1:22:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都過來
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.12,1:24:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.12,1:25:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.66,1:25:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.94,1:25:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想插了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.64,1:26:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.78,1:26:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.50,1:27:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.94,1:27:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.58,1:27:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想我讓你去吧？ 求我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.81,1:27:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.88,1:27:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流口水了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.02,1:27:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好淫蕩啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.80,1:28:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.12,1:28:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.08,1:28:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.52,1:30:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.12,1:30:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐在這裡
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.12,1:31:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起來
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.12,1:31:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要輪流舔
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.12,1:34:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,含到深處
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.12,1:34:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起來
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.85,1:34:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請插進來 已經忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.08,1:35:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.12,1:35:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.04,1:35:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腳抬高
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.00,1:36:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腳張開
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.91,1:36:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己來動
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.12,1:36:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.12,1:36:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.22,1:36:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.54,1:37:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.85,1:37:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.91,1:37:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳來含啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.51,1:38:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的只要肉棒都行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.12,1:38:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想怎麼做？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.12,1:38:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請插進來
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.39,1:38:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把腳抬高
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.06,1:39:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 快去了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.33,1:39:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想高潮嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.70,1:39:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要高潮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.60,1:39:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求我
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.90,1:39:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我高潮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.12,1:40:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流了這麼多汗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.81,1:41:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己插入
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.83,1:41:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,動激烈一點
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.82,1:41:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要肉棒嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.89,1:41:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要肉棒
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.72,1:41:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,含肉棒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.98,1:42:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.26,1:42:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.81,1:43:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快射了 要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.20,1:44:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被射了好多啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.91,1:44:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腳抬高
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.01,1:45:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.23,1:45:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是要扭腰到何時啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.87,1:45:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腳抬高
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.87,1:45:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.01,1:46:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.39,1:46:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.10,1:46:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.12,1:47:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.95,1:47:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽 要去了 要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.99,1:47:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.20,1:47:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全套弄出來
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.04,1:47:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要喔
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.67,1:48:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後每天...大家一起來癡漢你好了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.64,1:48:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.05,1:48:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後我變成沒有癡漢就活不下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.12,1:48:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,


